// Briev FFI Library — umbrella re-export.
//
// Import this module to pull in the common std surfaces (io, string,
// time, collections, encoding, json). The underlying helpers are pure
// Briev (2026-10-15 core-usable purge: the frgn/`__` bindings were
// removed); `frgn` now lives only in the interop lanes (lib/std/web/,
// lib/tamer/, lib/glue/).
//
